{
  "info": {
    "name": "Map Service (Team 14)",
    "description": "Geolocation updates, nearby players and proximity detection.\n\nOwner: Dackohn. Port: 8085 (reached through the gateway on 8080).\n\nEverything goes through the API Gateway (`{{gatewayUrl}}`, port 8080): players log in at User Management through it, and the gateway verifies their token and forwards requests with `X-User-Id` + `X-Gateway-Key` instead. The service itself accepts nothing else - the `... without the gateway` request shows the 401. Each run registers new players (`{{runId}}`), so it can be run repeatedly.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "gatewayUrl",
      "value": "http://localhost:8080"
    },
    {
      "key": "mapUrl",
      "value": "http://localhost:8085"
    },
    {
      "key": "password",
      "value": "Secret123!"
    },
    {
      "key": "runId",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "aliceToken",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "aliceId",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "bobToken",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "bobId",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "carolToken",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "carolId",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "daveToken",
      "value": ""
